Subject: [PATCH] fix(chat): spazio dopo il punto e frase intera in live /
 space after period and keep live sentence whole
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

IT: le bolle mid-turn arrivavano come `pulita.Sto…` e i chip strumenti spezzavano le parole. `ensureSentenceSpacing` inserisce lo spazio dopo `.`/`!`/`?`/`…`; la narrazione diventa messaggio chat solo a fine frase; il testo incompleto si riattacca anche con i chip in mezzo.

EN: mid-turn bubbles arrived as `pulita.Sto…` and tool chips split words. `ensureSentenceSpacing` inserts the missing space after `.`/`!`/`?`/`…`; narration is promoted to chat only at a sentence end; unfinished text rejoins even with chips in between.
